WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 2.3 · Theory of Change
Long-term impact

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Impact is the long-term change you will contribute to, alongside many others.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Start from your vision and the objective it serves.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Name whose lives or which conditions should improve.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Claim contribution, not attribution, and name others.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You write your impact statement and the other actors involved.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
